                "Array: children `2i+1`, `2i+2`; parent `(i-1)//2`",
                "`push`: append, ==sift up==, O(log n)",
                "`pop`: swap root with last, ==sift down==, O(log n)",
                "`peek` O(1); ==heapify== n items O(n)"
