              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Examples",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Top-k largest: ==min-heap of size k==, pop when over k, O(n log k)",
                "Trie node: `children[char]` + ==is_end==; one char per step"
